  "content": "<!-- Header Section End -->\n\n            <!-- Content Wrapper Start -->\n            <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n\n                <!-- Breadcrumb Start -->\n                <div class=\"breadcrumb-wrap bg-f br-1\">\n                    <div class=\"container\">\n                        <div class=\"breadcrumb-title\">\n                            <h2>Member Profile</h2>\n                            <ul class=\"breadcrumb-menu list-style\">\n                                <li><a href=\"/\">Home </a></li>\n                                <li><a href=\"/team\">Our Team</a></li>\n                                <li>Profile</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <!-- Breadcrumb End -->\n\n                <!-- Volunteer Details Section Start -->\n                <section class=\"team-details-wrap ptb-100\">\n                    <div class=\"container\">\n                        <div class=\"row gx-5\">\n                            <div class=\"col-lg-8 order-lg-1 order-2\">\n                                <div class=\"team-desc\">\n                                    <h1>John Bobor Smart</h1>\n                                    <p>Meet John, a dedicated environmental and climate change activist in Sierra Leone, whose passion and commitment to sustainability have made a profound impact in his community and beyond.</p>\n                                    <h5><strong>Educational Background</strong></h5>\n                                           <p> John holds a Diploma in Accounting and Finance, with a particular focus on financial management. His academic pursuits reflect his commitment to understanding the financial aspects of environmental initiatives.</p>\n                                           <p>Currently, John is pursuing a Degree in Project Management and Designing at the University of Advanced Management and Technology, further enhancing his skills in project coordination and execution.</p>\n                                   \n                                    \n                                    <h5><strong>Environmental Activism</strong></h5>\n                                    <p>John's journey as an environmental activist is marked by over four years of dedicated community work. His focus has been on two critical areas:</p>\n\n                                    <strong>Beach Beautification and Economic Tree Planting</strong>\n                                    <p>John has been instrumental in beach beautification efforts aimed at preserving natural landscapes. His dedication to economic tree planting aligns with his vision for environmental sustainability and food security to support a growing population.</p>\n\n                                   <strong>Climate Change Mitigation and Adaptation</strong>\n                                    <p>John's work extends to raising awareness about climate change in communities, schools, and colleges. His campaigns on environmental justice have ignited a sense of responsibility among local residents to actively engage in climate action.</p>\n                                    <h5><strong>Professional Experience</strong></h5>\n                                    <p>John's dedication to community and environmental causes is also reflected in his professional experiences:</p>\n                                    <strong>National Coordinator for Earth Regenerative Project Sierra Leone</strong>\n                                    <p>In this role, John oversees and monitors tree planting activities across various project sites. Under his leadership, over twenty thousand economic trees of different varieties have been planted in several communities in Tonkolili District.</p>\n                                    <strong>Save the Children International</strong>\n                                    <p>John's role as the Safety and Security Coordinator involved briefing international staff on security matters, updating pre-departure information, and managing safety and security plans. He also reported all security situations to the regional office in Senegal.</p>\n                                   <h5><strong>Global Engagement</strong></h5>\n                                    <p>John's commitment to environmental sustainability extends to his involvement in global initiatives. He is an Alumni of the Young African Leaders Initiative and WYSE International Global Change Makers. His designation as an Island Innovation Ambassador and a Certified Climate Reality Leader underscores his dedication to tackling climate challenges on a broader scale.</p>\n                                    <h5><strong>Vision and Aspirations</strong></h5>\n                                    <p>John is driven by a deep passion for environmental protection, climate change mitigation, and adaptation. His ultimate vision is to see a world where urgent action is taken to protect the environment, where greenhouse gas emissions are no longer a threat, and where communities thrive in harmony with nature.</p>\n                                    <p>John's journey as an environmental activist and community leader serves as an inspiring example of the positive impact that dedicated individuals can have on their communities and the planet. His commitment to sustainability and climate action is a testament to the positive change that is possible through passion, dedication, and a vision for a better world.</p>\n                                    <strong></strong>\n                             \n                                    \n                                    <div class=\"row progess-bar-item\">\n                                        <div class=\"col-md-3 col-6\">\n                                            <div class=\"single-skill\">\n                                                <div class=\"circlechart\" data-percentage=\"85\">\n                                                    <svg class=\"circle-chart\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.83098862 33.83098862\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                                                        <circle class=\"circle-chart__background\" cx=\"16.9\" cy=\"16.9\" r=\"15.9\"></circle>\n                                                        <circle class=\"circle-chart__circle\" stroke-dasharray=\"92,100\" cx=\"16.9\" cy=\"16.9\" r=\"15.9\"></circle>\n                                                        <g class=\"circle-chart__info\">  \n                                                                <text class=\"circle-chart__percent\" x=\"17.9\" y=\"20\">89%</text>\n                                                        </g>\n                                                    </svg>\n                                                </div>\n                                                <p>Team Work</p>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"col-md-3 col-6\">\n                                                <div class=\"single-skill\">\n                                                    <div class=\"circlechart\" data-percentage=\"70\">\n                                                        <svg class=\"circle-chart\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.83098862 33.83098862\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                                                            <circle class=\"circle-chart__background\" cx=\"16.9\" cy=\"16.9\" r=\"15.9\"></circle>\n                                                            <circle class=\"circle-chart__circle\" stroke-dasharray=\"92,100\" cx=\"16.9\" cy=\"16.9\" r=\"15.9\"></circle>\n                                                            <g class=\"circle-chart__info\">  \n                                                                <text class=\"circle-chart__percent\" x=\"17.9\" y=\"20\">70%</text>\n                                                            </g>\n                                                        </svg>\n                                                    </div>\n                                                    <p>Communication</p>\n                                                </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"col-md-3 col-6\">\n                                            <div class=\"single-skill\">\n                                                <div class=\"circlechart\" data-percentage=\"90\">\n                                                    <svg class=\"circle-chart\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.83098862 33.83098862\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                                                        <circle class=\"circle-chart__background\" cx=\"16.9\" cy=\"16.9\" r=\"15.9\"></circle>\n                                                        <circle class=\"circle-chart__circle\" stroke-dasharray=\"92,100\" cx=\"16.9\" cy=\"16.9\" r=\"15.9\"></circle>\n                                                        <g class=\"circle-chart__info\">  \n                                                            <text class=\"circle-chart__percent\" x=\"17.9\" y=\"20\">90%</text>\n                                                        </g>\n                                                    </svg>\n                                                </div>\n                                                <p>Successful Project</p>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"col-md-3 col-6\">\n                                                <div class=\"single-skill\">\n                                                    <div class=\"circlechart\" data-percentage=\"75\">\n                                                        <svg class=\"circle-chart\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.83098862 33.83098862\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                                                            <circle class=\"circle-chart__background\" cx=\"16.9\" cy=\"16.9\" r=\"15.9\"></circle>\n                                                            <circle class=\"circle-chart__circle\" stroke-dasharray=\"92,100\" cx=\"16.9\" cy=\"16.9\" r=\"15.9\"></circle>\n                                                            <g class=\"circle-chart__info\">  \n                                                                <text class=\"circle-chart__percent\" x=\"17.9\" y=\"20\">82%</text>\n                                                            </g>\n                                                        </svg>\n                                                    </div>\n                                                    <p>Events Participation</p>\n                                                </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                \n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"col-lg-4 order-lg-2 order-1\">\n                                <div class=\"sidebar style2\">\n                                    <div class=\"sidebar-widget style2\">\n                                        <div class=\"profile-widget\">\n                                            <img src=\"/assets/img/team/team-7.jpg\" alt=\"Image\">\n                                            <button id=\"downloadResumeButton\" class=\"btn style1\">Download Resume</button>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                    \n                                    <div class=\"sidebar-widget\">\n                                        <div class=\"project-info-item-wrap\">\n                                         